MaterialNPC: {
	DisplayName: Astral Trader
	Name.MaterialNPC: ""
	PortraitName: Astral Trader

	Chat: {
		Normal1: If you're tired, look up at the stars. They all look pretty much the same, but that doesn't stop us from letting our minds go blank and drift off wherever they like for a while, does it?
		Normal2: Hello there. Looking for some materials? Just tell me the name. Even if I don't have it now, I'll keep an eye out for it on my next voyage.
		Normal3: If you ever leave this world to travel and adventure somewhere else, remember to drop my name. Some of the ports along the way give discounts to regular customers. What, you don't believe me? Hmph~ In sailing circles, I'm quite famous.
		Normal4: Captain? Me? I suppose. But I'd rather people just called me the Astral Trader. Captain sounds too proper, a bit too puffed up. It doesn't suit someone whose sights are set on the sea of stars~
		Normal5: You may have heard stories about me elsewhere, saying I'm someone who crosses the sea of stars and travels from world to world? Haha. I can assure you, those are all rumors. I'm just a perfectly ordinary trader, that's all.
	}

