NatureNPC: {
	DisplayName: Flower Picker
	Name.NatureNPC: Little Sunny
	PortraitName: Flower Picker Little Sunny

	Chat: {
		Normal1: Heya! If you're ever feeling down, come play with me. I've got flowers, and grass, and fish, and a whole garden's worth of stories~
		Normal2_Male: Does adventuring and fighting all over this world wear you out, brother? If you ever get completely exhausted, come and smell the flowers here. The smell of sunshine makes you forget all your worries.
		Normal2_Female: Does adventuring and fighting all over this world wear you out, sister? If you ever get completely exhausted, come and smell the flowers here. The smell of sunshine makes you forget all your worries.
		Normal3: I found out that the goldfish here, when it rains, use their tails as feet and go for a slow stroll along the shore. Usually they're swimming in the water, so tell me, how can there even be creatures this amazing and this cute?
		Normal4_Male: A huge swallowtail just landed on the tip of my nose! I held my breath for so long, I was scared of scaring it off, and when it flew away it even brushed against me a little! Brother, tell me, isn't that just amazing?
		Normal4_Female: A huge swallowtail just landed on the tip of my nose! I held my breath for so long, I was scared of scaring it off, and when it flew away it even brushed against me a little! Sister, tell me, isn't that just amazing?
		Normal5: Slimes are all soft and squishy, like jelly! They do jump up and bump into people sometimes, but as long as they don't get my clothes dirty, I still think they're really cute.
		Normal6: Hm? You're asking what I'll use if I sell you the [c/45CDFF:Sunlight BugNet]? Hehe, I've got a whole pile of old nets here that ran out ages ago and lost their Transcendent Power. If they're any use to you, take one as a souvenir~
		Normal7: The kids from the Rafflesia Tribe keep saying I'm too loud, so I'd rather play with the kids from the Snow Lotus Tribe. Because I think a garden that's gone all quiet, that's what's really scary!
	}

